Third-party code

MaxText
  https://github.com/AI-Hypercomputer/maxtext
  (pull request #5364, commit 61ef5db17a9fbefc8e4cca5e0caa0b506ae893e7; branch
  atwigg/mlperf at a51bcf5 with pull request #5399)
  Copyright 2023-2026 Google LLC. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  Adapted in src/tjev/kernels/gated_delta_rule/pallas_tpu.py (the Pallas TPU recurrence
  design: reverse chunk order through the index maps, the state carried in VMEM scratch,
  saved per-chunk states; the bf16_3x precision policy). The file header describes the
  changes. cloud/tpu_env.sh takes its libtpu flag set from benchmarks/xla_flags_library.py.

  The design of src/tjev/kernels/gated_delta_rule/pallas_tpu_v2.py (saved (I+L)⁻¹ and
  per-chunk states, one reverse backward kernel, heads as the dot batch dimension, the
  shared-operand matmuls, the bf16_3x / one-pass precision split) follows the atwigg/mlperf
  GDN kernels (src/maxtext/kernels/gdn/, gdn_bwd/; pull requests #5153, #5273, #5274,
  #5399). No code was copied.

  The GDN megakernels of src/tjev/kernels/gated_delta_rule/pallas_tpu_mega.py follow the
  same branch's forward (src/maxtext/kernels/gdn/wrapper.py, compute_conv1d.py,
  compute_gdn.py: the conv halo carried in VMEM scratch, the in-kernel gates, l2norm, q
  scale and GQA) and backward (gdn_bwd/pallas_mosaic_tpu_bwd.py: the in-kernel l2norm and
  gate backward), and the blocked inverse of pallas_tpu_v2.py its
  compute_gdn.invert_triangular_matrix (16-row diagonal blocks by forward substitution).
  No code was copied.

flash-linear-attention
  https://github.com/fla-org/flash-linear-attention (fla/ops/gated_delta_rule)
  Copyright (c) 2023-2026 Songlin Yang, Yu Zhang, Zhiyuan Li. Licensed under the MIT License.
  The closed-form backward of src/tjev/kernels/gated_delta_rule/pallas_tpu_v2.py (the
  inverse's gradient without differentiating through it, the gate gradient from row sums)
  follows its algebra. No code was copied.
  The conv backward of src/tjev/kernels/gated_delta_rule/pallas_tpu_mega.py (the
  anti-causal d(input) with the pre-activation recomputed, fla/modules/conv/triton/kernels.py)
  and the 16x16 diagonal solve of pallas_tpu_v2.py's blocked inverse (fla/ops/utils/
  solve_tril.py) follow its algebra. No code was copied.

causal-conv1d
  https://github.com/Dao-AILab/causal-conv1d (csrc/causal_conv1d_bwd.cu)
  Copyright (c) 2024, Tri Dao. Licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License.
  The conv backward of src/tjev/kernels/gated_delta_rule/pallas_tpu_mega.py (per-token
