Algorithms implemented from their papers (no code copied):
  * ZClip adaptive gradient clipping (arXiv 2504.02507): src/tjev/train/optim.py.
  * Polar Express Newton-Schulz coefficients (Amsel et al., arXiv 2505.16932; reference
    values from github.com/NoahAmsel/PolarExpress): src/tjev/train/optim.py.
  * WSD schedule with a (1 - sqrt) cooldown (Hägele et al., arXiv 2405.18392):
    src/tjev/train/optim.py.
  * The learning-rate transfer rules of src/tjev/campaign/plan.py cite their sources in
    its docstring.
